 219:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO2.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLFClk.c **** * be compensated is passed through the desiredDelay parameter. The compensated 
