 400:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO2.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLFClk.c **** * \note SysClk should be sourced by IMO. Otherwise CySysClkIloTrim() and 
