 700:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO2.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLFClk.c ****     * LFCLK, because the glitch risk is around the LFCLK positive edge. To ensure
 701:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO2.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLFClk.c ****     * that the switch can be done safely, the WDT counter value is read until it
 702:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO2.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLFClk.c ****     * changes.
 703:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO2.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLFClk.c ****     *
 704:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO2.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLFClk.c ****     * That means that the positive edge just finished and the switch is performed.
 705:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO2.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLFClk.c ****     * The enabled WDT counter is used for that purpose. If no counters are enabled,
 706:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO2.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLFClk.c ****     * counter 0 is enabled. And after the LFCLK source is switched, counter 0
 707:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO2.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLFClk.c ****     * configuration is restored.
 708:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO2.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLFClk.c ****     *
 709:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO2.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLFClk.c ****     *  The function is applicable only for devices with more than one source for 
 710:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO2.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLFClk.c ****     * LFCLK - PSoC 4100 BLE / PSoC 4200 BLE / PRoC BLE / PSoC 4100M / PSoC 4200M / 
 711:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO2.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLFClk.c ****     * PSoC 4200L.
 712:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO2.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLFClk.c ****     *
 713:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO2.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLFClk.c ****     * \note For PSoC 4000S / PSoC 4100S / PSoC Analog Coprocessor devices LFCLK can
 714:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO2.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLFClk.c ****     * only be sourced from ILO even though WCO is available.
