 723:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO2.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLFClk.c ****     * This function has no effect if WDT is locked (CySysWdtLock() is called). 
