 729:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO2.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLFClk.c ****     * Changing the LFCLK clock source may change the LFCLK clock frequency and
 730:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO2.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLFClk.c ****     * affect the functionality that uses this clock. For example, watchdog timer
